# SS-09 - Constrained AI strategy hypotheses and evaluation
Workstream ID: SS-09
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/StonksSniper/issues/9
Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M3
Dependencies: SS-06, SS-07, SS-10

## Purpose
Propose testable new rule combinations without inventing novelty or validated performance.

## Tasks
- [ ] Select an explicit opt-in local/model API provider and privacy/cost boundary.
- [ ] Define a constrained declarative rule schema; never execute generated source code.
- [ ] Record model/version/prompt/source/parameter provenance and hypothesis identity.
- [ ] Reject invalid/data-leaking proposals and separate established vs AI-created variants.
- [ ] Run fixed holdouts/walk-forward tests with multiple-testing controls.
- [ ] Show actual engine results, rejected hypotheses and out-of-sample limitations.

## Acceptance criteria
- AI cannot supply market observations, fake returns or self-certify strategy success.
- No remote model receives private datasets or account data without explicit consent.

## Completion evidence
- Not started. No AI provider is connected or billed.

## Completion log
- 2026-11-11: Registered controlled hypothesis research; no guaranteed novelty/profit claims.
